{"strongs": "H7654", "word": "שָׂבְעָה", "translit": "sov.ah", "root": "שבע", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "satiety", "definition": "שָׂבְעָה , [ שִׂבְעָה ] noun feminine satiety ; — absolute ׳ שׂ Isa 56:11 +, construct שִׂבְעַתֿ Ezek 16:49 , sf, שָׂבְעָתַךְ v Ezek 16:28 — 1. as to food, especially ׳ אָכַל לְשׂ eat to satiety, one's fill , Isa 23:18 ; Ezek 39:19 ׳ לְשׂ also Isa 55:2 (figurative); ׳ שׂ of dogs Isa 56:11 (figurative); לֶֿחֶםָ ׳ שׂ leading to arrogance, as sin of Sodom Ezek 16:49 (+ גָּאוֺם , etc.). 2. to carnal desire Ezek 16:28 (figurative).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8154')\">BDB8154</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7653')\">H7653</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H7654')\">H7654</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8153')\">BDB8153</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8155')\">BDB8155</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שָׂבְעָה</bdbheb>, [<bdbheb>שִׂבְעָה</bdbheb>] <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>satiety</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 56:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,11)\">Isa 56:11</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>שִׂבְעַתֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:49\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,49)\">Ezek 16:49</ref>, sf, <bdbheb>שָׂבְעָתַךְ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ezek 16:28\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,28)\">Ezek 16:28</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> as to food, especially <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אָכַל לְשׂ</bdbheb> <highlight>eat to satiety, one's fill</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Isa 23:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,23,18)\">Isa 23:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,19)\">Ezek 39:19</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְשׂ</bdbheb> also <ref ref=\"Isa 55:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,55,2)\">Isa 55:2</ref> (figurative); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׂ</bdbheb> of dogs <ref ref=\"Isa 56:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,11)\">Isa 56:11</ref> (figurative); <bdbheb>לֶֿחֶםָ</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׂ</bdbheb> leading to arrogance, as sin of Sodom <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:49\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,49)\">Ezek 16:49</ref> (+ <bdbheb>גָּאוֺם</bdbheb>, etc.). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> to carnal desire <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:28\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,28)\">Ezek 16:28</ref> (figurative). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 56:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 56, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ezek 16:49", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 16, "verse": 49}, {"raw": "Ezek 16:28", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 16, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Isa 23:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 23, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Ezek 39:19", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 39, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Isa 55:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 55, "verse": 2}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["שָׂבְעָה", "שִׂבְעָה", "׳", "שׂ", "שִׂבְעַתֿ", "שָׂבְעָתַךְ", "אָכַל לְשׂ", "לְשׂ", "לֶֿחֶםָ", "גָּאוֺם"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": ["H7653", "H7654"], "bdbid": "BDB8154", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}